<title>BELGIUM: Belgian unemployment edges up slightly in June.</title>
<headline>Belgian unemployment edges up slightly in June.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian Employment Ministry released the following unemployment data -</p>
<p>    BELGIAN UNEMPLOYMENT	   June	 May	 June 1996</p>
<p>    Total registered jobless (*) 540,562    n/a	 544,897</p>
<p>    Total benefit recipients (!) 456,745    448,352   465,033</p>
<p>    Pct of workforce		 12.6	 12.5	12.8</p>
<p>NOTE - (*) all registered unemployed, whether or not they receive unemployment benefits; (!) excluding those over 55 whom the Office regards as too old for the labour market.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
